  </div>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="tier"><div class="tier-label">— ALSO ON THE CALENDAR</div>
    <div class="tier-3">
      <a href="#">Cap Hill Stoop Coffee</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">Friday Run Club</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
