  <div class="lineup-cta"><a href="#" class="btn-yellow">Full calendar →</a></div>
</section>

<section class="cta-final">
  <h2>See you out there.</h2>
  <p>Pick one event this week. That's the only ask.</p>
  <a href="#" class="btn-yellow">Browse events →</a>
</section>

</body></html>
